    "detailed_description": "<br><br>Your mission is to be part of a skillful group of mercenary geese tasked with vanquishing dark forces to proclaim a new era of justice.<br>But the task will be impossible alone, join up with other geese to make your party complete.<br>The party will always need three combat ready geese.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Warrior</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658580/extras/66493d16f2698ae33b5879068eb2415d.poster.avif?t=1711121078\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658580/extras/66493d16f2698ae33b5879068eb2415d.webm?t=1711121078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>&quot;With wings spread wide, I take my place at the frontline and the honor is all mine!&quot; - The Warrior<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Cleric</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658580/extras/59b6c6fcc5906cf4cf0c683d732a95c8.poster.avif?t=1711121078\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658580/extras/59b6c6fcc5906cf4cf0c683d732a95c8.webm?t=1711121078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>&quot;Honk softly, dear, I shall mend your wounds with love.&quot; - The Cleric<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Archer</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658580/extras/85f33da5f4480b386c936a7cb59af1b3.poster.avif?t=1711121078\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658580/extras/85f33da5f4480b386c936a7cb59af1b3.webm?t=1711121078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>&quot;Arrows made out of my own feathers always hit the target.&quot; - The Archer<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>\u25cf Online co-op, you won't survive alone!<br>\u25cf Random matchmaking, no friends, no problem!<br>\u25cf Class selection, start with the basic classes and unlock many more.<br>\u25cf Journey selection, choose the adventure you embark on.<br>\u25cf Party leveling up, democratically pick an upgrade that will serve the group best.<br>\u25cf Account progression, anything you do during the journey will be rewarded.<br>\u25cf Daily missions, the job never ends.<br>\u25cf Customization, unlock skins &amp; more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who &amp; why?</h2>Hey, hi, I'm Mads, I'm fascinated with silly ideas such as this one.<br>I've made a bunch of games in the past, you can check out my stuff at mads.games.<br>I love playing games with my pals and actually I'm making this game with some friends, so the only logical step was to create a multiplayer goose game.<br>My hope is that I'll make this game and a bunch of friends around the world can play, laugh and create some fun memories.<br><br>And if you don't like geese I completely understand, they can be really sassy sometimes.",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br>Your mission is to be part of a skillful group of mercenary geese tasked with vanquishing dark forces to proclaim a new era of justice.<br>But the task will be impossible alone, join up with other geese to make your party complete.<br>The party will always need three combat ready geese.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Warrior</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658580/extras/66493d16f2698ae33b5879068eb2415d.poster.avif?t=1711121078\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658580/extras/66493d16f2698ae33b5879068eb2415d.webm?t=1711121078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>&quot;With wings spread wide, I take my place at the frontline and the honor is all mine!&quot; - The Warrior<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Cleric</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658580/extras/59b6c6fcc5906cf4cf0c683d732a95c8.poster.avif?t=1711121078\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658580/extras/59b6c6fcc5906cf4cf0c683d732a95c8.webm?t=1711121078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>&quot;Honk softly, dear, I shall mend your wounds with love.&quot; - The Cleric<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Archer</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658580/extras/85f33da5f4480b386c936a7cb59af1b3.poster.avif?t=1711121078\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658580/extras/85f33da5f4480b386c936a7cb59af1b3.webm?t=1711121078\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>&quot;Arrows made out of my own feathers always hit the target.&quot; - The Archer<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>\u25cf Online co-op, you won't survive alone!<br>\u25cf Random matchmaking, no friends, no problem!<br>\u25cf Class selection, start with the basic classes and unlock many more.<br>\u25cf Journey selection, choose the adventure you embark on.<br>\u25cf Party leveling up, democratically pick an upgrade that will serve the group best.<br>\u25cf Account progression, anything you do during the journey will be rewarded.<br>\u25cf Daily missions, the job never ends.<br>\u25cf Customization, unlock skins &amp; more.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who &amp; why?</h2>Hey, hi, I'm Mads, I'm fascinated with silly ideas such as this one.<br>I've made a bunch of games in the past, you can check out my stuff at mads.games.<br>I love playing games with my pals and actually I'm making this game with some friends, so the only logical step was to create a multiplayer goose game.<br>My hope is that I'll make this game and a bunch of friends around the world can play, laugh and create some fun memories.<br><br>And if you don't like geese I completely understand, they can be really sassy sometimes.",
    "short_description": "Join your gaggle of fearless friends and honk your way into adventure. Whether you're tanking as a stubborn goose or healing your flock with compassionate honks, every role counts in this coop dungeon crawler!",
